    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d273">

                <pb facs="0382" n="262" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg262"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Reyes to
                        President Roosevelt.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-12-25"><hi rendition="#italic">December 25,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Sincerely obliged for your congratulations. Minister Mendoza is charged to pay
                    your excellency visit in my name on this occasion. Peace is assured all over the
                    country.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Reyes.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
